{% doc %}
  FAQ Shipping — English (accordion entries).
  @param contact_url {string}
{% enddoc %}

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>How does shipping work?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Resell Lausanne delivers to Switzerland and Europe through reliable carriers such as Swiss Post, DHL, or FedEx — depending on destination, product, and the most suitable shipping method.</p>
    <p>Most orders are delivered within 5 to 10 business days. Express shipping in 2 to 5 business days is available for eligible products. Delivery times may vary based on availability, sourcing location, carrier, and peak demand periods.</p>
    <p>Every order is processed individually to keep your purchase simple, secure, and transparent.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Why do some products take longer to deliver?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Resell Lausanne works with a very large catalogue. Some items are readily available, while others are sourced through our network of professional resellers and partners in Switzerland, Europe, or internationally.</p>
    <p>When a product is not immediately on hand, we first locate it through our partner network, have it inspected, and only ship it after verification.</p>
    <p>This allows us to offer a broader catalogue and competitive prices while maintaining high authenticity standards.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>How does an order work?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>After placing your order, you will automatically receive a confirmation email with an estimated delivery timeframe.</p>
    <p>Your order then goes through several steps:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Sourcing and ordering</strong><br>We find and order your pair through our partner network.</li>
      <li><strong>Shipment to the authentication centre</strong><br>Tracking may show "delivered" once the pair arrives at our facility or a partner — not yet at your address.</li>
      <li><strong>Receipt and inspection</strong><br>Authenticity, condition, and compliance with your order are verified.</li>
      <li><strong>Preparation</strong><br>Once approved, the package is carefully packed.</li>
      <li><strong>Shipment to you</strong><br>You receive a new tracking email for the final delivery.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>We keep you informed by email at key stages.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>What happens after I place my order?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>After confirmation, you will receive an email. If the product needs to be sourced, it first comes to us or to our processing centre — with updates along the way if applicable.</p>
    <p>Upon arrival, it is inspected, packed in original packaging where possible, securely wrapped, and sent to your address.</p>
    <p>You will receive a tracking number when the final shipment is dispatched.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>What are the delivery times?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Standard: approximately 5 to 10 business days in Switzerland and Europe.</p>
    <p>Express: 2 to 5 business days for selected products.</p>
    <p>These are estimates and may take longer depending on availability, partner, peak periods, or carrier.</p>
    <p>We process and ship as quickly as possible — with thorough item verification.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>I ordered multiple items but only received one. Is that normal?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Yes. Each item is sourced individually.</p>
    <p>Multiple products may be shipped separately and arrive on different dates.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Are weekends included in delivery times?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>No. All timeframes are in business days.</p>
    <p>Weekends and public holidays do not count. 10 business days is roughly two calendar weeks.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>What is express delivery?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Available for selected products only. These are already within the logistics network or can be sourced with priority for faster dispatch.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Why are some products delivered faster than others?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Each product has its own availability and sourcing path.</p>
    <p>Some styles are immediately available from partners; others require more time for sourcing, inspection, and transport.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Delivery in Switzerland</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Shipping within Switzerland is free on orders over 50 CHF (otherwise a flat fee applies at checkout).</p>
    <p>Most orders are sent via Swiss Post or an equivalent carrier. Once handed over, you will receive tracking by email.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Delivery in Europe</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>We also deliver to Europe — flat fee of 10 CHF.</p>
    <p>Depending on the country, we use DHL, FedEx, Swiss Post, or a partner carrier. Outside Switzerland, local VAT, customs, or import fees may apply (customer responsibility).</p>
    <p>Where possible, EU orders are shipped from within Europe.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>How much does delivery cost?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Free in Switzerland on orders over 50 CHF. 10 CHF flat rate to Europe.</p>
    <p>International orders may trigger local taxes or customs charges.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>How can I track my package?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>After dispatch, you will receive an email with a tracking link.</p>
    <p>Before that, your order may still be being sourced or inspected — with updates possible before the final shipment.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Why haven't I received a tracking number yet?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>The final tracking number is only issued once your order has been packed and handed over to the carrier.</p>
    <p>During sourcing or inspection, a delay is normal — your order is not blocked.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>My delivery time seems exceeded — what should I do?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Delays can occur due to availability, partners, additional inspection, or the carrier.</p>
    <p>If your order exceeds the estimated timeframe, contact us at <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>. We will check the status and get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>What happens if my package is not collected?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>If your package is not collected or accepted within the carrier’s holding period (Swiss Post or another carrier), it is returned to us.</p>
    <p>A reshipment can be arranged on request for a <strong>flat fee of CHF&nbsp;20.–</strong>. This covers:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>about CHF&nbsp;9.– for the Post return label / billing&nbsp;;</li>
      <li>about CHF&nbsp;7.– for the new outbound shipping label&nbsp;;</li>
      <li>the balance for parcel search and handling.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Without a reshipment request (or payment of these fees), the parcel remains on hold under our terms. Contact us at <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>
